    "Decode ingested video on the CPU instead of using the hardware video decoder. Uses more CPU, battery and generates more heat, but can decode video the hardware decoder does not support and allows decoding more streams at the same time." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the software video decoding setting.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dekodiert das eingehende Video auf der CPU, anstatt den Hardware Videodekoder zu verwenden. Dies beansprucht die CPU stärker, verbraucht mehr Akkuleistung und erzeugt mehr Wärme, ermöglicht jedoch die Dekodierung von Videos, die der Hardware-Dekoder nicht unterstützt und erlaubt die gleichzeitige Dekodierung mehrerer Streams."
          }
        },
        "eo" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "D3c0d3 1ng3st3d v1d30 0n th3 CP_ 1nst34d 0f _s1ng th3 h4rdw4r3 v1d30 d3c0d3r. _s3s m0r3 CP_, b4tt3ry 4nd g3n3r4t3s m0r3 h34t, b_t c4n d3c0d3 v1d30 th3 h4rdw4r3 d3c0d3r d03s n0t s_pp0rt 4nd 4ll0ws d3c0d1ng m0r3 str34ms 4t th3 s4m3 t1m3."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decodifica el vídeo ingerido en la CPU en lugar de utilizar el decodificador de vídeo por hardware. Utiliza más CPU, batería y genera más calor, pero puede decodificar video que el decodificador de hardware no admite y permite decodificar más transmisiones al mismo tiempo."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decode ingested video on the CPU instead of using the hardware video decoder. Uses more CPU, battery and generates more heat, but can decode video the hardware decoder does not support and allows decoding more streams at the same time."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Décodez la vidéo ingérée sur le processeur au lieu d'utiliser le décodeur vidéo matériel. Utilise plus de CPU, de batterie et génère plus de chaleur, mais peut décoder la vidéo que le décodeur matériel ne prend pas en charge et permet de décoder plus de flux en même temps."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decode ingested video on the CPU instead of using the hardware video decoder. Uses more CPU, battery and generates more heat, but can decode video the hardware decoder does not support and allows decoding more streams at the same time."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decode ingested video on the CPU instead of using the hardware video decoder. Uses more CPU, battery and generates more heat, but can decode video the hardware decoder does not support and allows decoding more streams at the same time."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Decodifica il video ricevuto sulla CPU invece che col decoder hardware. Usa più CPU e batteria e scalda di più, ma supporta video che l'hardware non decodifica e più stream contemporaneamente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "ハードウェア ビデオ デコーダを使用する代わりに、取り込まれたビデオを CPU でデコードします。より多くの CPU とバッテリーを使用し、より多くの熱を発生しますが、ハードウェア デコーダーがサポートしていないビデオをデコードでき、より多くのストリームを同時にデコードできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decode ingested video on the CPU instead of using the hardware video decoder. Uses more CPU, battery and generates more heat, but can decode video the hardware decoder does not support and allows decoding more streams at the same time."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decodeer opgenomen video op de CPU in plaats van de hardwarevideodecoder te gebruiken. Gebruikt meer CPU, batterij en genereert meer warmte, maar kan video decoderen die de hardwaredecoder niet ondersteunt en maakt het mogelijk om meer streams tegelijkertijd te decoderen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Dekoduj pobrane wideo na procesorze zamiast używać sprzętowego dekodera wideo. Zużywa więcej procesora, baterii i generuje więcej ciepła, ale może dekodować wideo, którego dekoder sprzętowy nie obsługuje i umożliwia dekodowanie większej liczby strumieni jednocześnie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decode ingested video on the CPU instead of using the hardware video decoder. Uses more CPU, battery and generates more heat, but can decode video the hardware decoder does not support and allows decoding more streams at the same time."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decodifique o vídeo ingerido na CPU em vez de usar o decodificador de vídeo de hardware. Usa mais CPU, bateria e gera mais calor, mas pode decodificar vídeo que o decodificador de hardware não suporta e permite decodificar mais fluxos ao mesmo tempo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Декодируйте полученное видео на ЦП вместо использования аппаратного видеодекодера. Использует больше процессора, батареи и выделяет больше тепла, но может декодировать видео, которое аппаратный декодер не поддерживает, и позволяет одновременно декодировать больше потоков."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Decode ingested video on the CPU instead of using the hardware video decoder. Uses more CPU, battery and generates more heat, but can decode video the hardware decoder does not support and allows decoding more streams at the same time."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Avkoda intagen video på CPU:n istället för att använda hårdvaruvideoavkodaren. Använder mer CPU, batteri och genererar mer värme, men kan avkoda video som hårdvaruavkodaren inte stöder och tillåter avkodning av fler strömmar samtidigt."
          }
        },
