    "The name of your BRB scene in OBS. Moblin will periodically try to switch from your main scene to this scene if the stream is likely broken." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Name deiner BRB-Szene in OBS. Moblin versucht regelmäßig, von deiner Hauptszene zu dieser Szene zu wechseln, wenn der Stream wahrscheinlich unterbrochen ist."
